  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.3.0 - Whisper GPU runtime moved from build-time bundling to runtime download. Cuda and Vulkan native binaries are no longer included in the package; they are fetched on first GPU use from https://github.com/fieldcure/fieldcure-whisper-runtimes (GitHub Releases) and cached under %LOCALAPPDATA%\\FieldCure\\WhisperRuntimes\\. Three-phase capability lifecycle introduced: Detect (system inspection) / Provision (binary acquisition) / Activate (Whisper.net configuration). New API surface: WhisperEnvironment.Detect() (Probe() retained as an [Obsolete] alias, removed in v0.4), IWhisperRuntimeProvisioner, GitHubReleasesWhisperRuntimeProvisioner, WhisperRuntime.Activate / GetActivationStatus, AudioExtractionOptions.ProgressCallback. WhisperEnvironmentInfo.CudaAvailable renamed to CudaDriverAvailable (old name [Obsolete]) and gains CudaDriverVersion. Air-gapped environments: set FIELDCURE_WHISPER_RUNTIME_DIR to a pre-staged directory to skip all network calls. Audio.csproj drops Whisper.net.Runtime.Cuda and Whisper.net.Runtime.Vulkan PackageReferences; CPU runtime remains bundled.",
